    "detailed_description": "Experience authentic nostalgia through 12 large worlds! Guide a small toy into adventure as a mysterious event takes hold. Inspired by Toy Story 2 on the original playstation, embark on a journey where everything is large and you are small! Visit carnivals and even a bowling alley! Each level was crafted with the utmost care and treats the player with respect. So buckle in retro gamers and new gamers alike and prepare for a true retro experience!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGAME FEATURES <br />\r\n-*Keyboard and Mouse Support<br />\r\n*Game Controller Support<br />\r\n1. 12 Large and well designed levels with varying themes.<br />\r\n2. A simple approach to gaming to help anyone of any age jump right in!<br />\r\n3. A soundtrack that is just as amazing as the levels!<br />\r\n4. Two story modes that change things up!<br />\r\n5. A interactive game board that serves as the level hub.<br />\r\n6. Explore the story by reading the lore box's spread about the areas!<br />\r\n7. Authentic nostalgia that is sure to make you smile!",
